WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.479
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:10.479 --> 00:00:11.477
[ALARM RINGING]

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:13.972
[GRUNTS]

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:15.890
 Aw, I hate when I do that.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.020
 Keep an eye on me, Gambit.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.857
You might learn something.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.990
 This is your first
Christmas as an X-Man, and we

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.940
need to make it extra special.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.140
 It already is.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.530
 Observe.

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:44.220
First, we charge the cue.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.220
 Maybe Monsieur Gambit's not
as good as he thinks he is.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:58.070
 I must first find my sister
and maybe see more of America

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:00.015
after I fix your house.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:06.000
 I never realized how
much this dump meant to me

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.290
till somebody wiped it out.

00:01:14.595 --> 00:01:16.543
[ALARM SOUNDING]

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:24.100
 It will take time to put right
what Sinister tried to destroy.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.670
Thankfully, the X-Men have
proved what I'd always hoped,

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:30.220
that in my absence they
can carry on together

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.570
with our important work.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.700
 After what we've
been through lately,

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.670
I figured we could
use some time off.

00:01:50.945 --> 00:01:52.418
 What the heck?

00:01:52.418 --> 00:01:54.490
Destroy all mutants?

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:56.935
With the friends of
humanity, who needs enemies?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.070
 Where's that blasted salami?

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:06.620
I can smell it.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:11.680
Ah, all it needs is slicing.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.600
 While you're at
it, fix one for me.

